NOT FOR CLINICAL USE.

This software is a research artifact. It has not been evaluated or approved by
any regulatory body, and reconstructions it produces must not be used to inform
patient care. Learned reconstruction methods can introduce or remove image
features that appear anatomically plausible but are not present in the acquired
measurements; the data-consistency layer constrains, but does not eliminate,
this behaviour.

The fastMRI dataset is distributed by NYU Langone Health under its own terms.
Obtain it from https://fastmri.med.nyu.edu/ and comply with that agreement; it
is not redistributed here.
